{"code":"143210","name":"핸즈코퍼레이션","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1972년 동화합판 주식회사로 설립되어 1984년 알루미늄 휠 제조업을 개시한 자동차 부품 전문 기업임. 현재 6개의 비상장 종속회사를 보유하고 있으며, 자회사 핸즈식스는 대형 고급사양 휠 생산에 특화되어 있음. 완성차 제조업체를 대상으로 주문자 상표 부착 생산(OEM) 방식으로 알루미늄 휠을 공급하고 있으며, 현대기아차그룹, GM그룹, 르노닛산그룹 등 글로벌 완성차 업체를 주요 고객으로 확보하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":1199.0,"open":1199.0,"high":1199.0,"low":1199.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":-25.0625,"ma20":1199.0,"ma60":1199.0,"ma120":1199.0,"ma200":1188.16,"close_vs_ma200":0.9123,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":1.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":-15.8861,"r2_250":0.3087,"high52":1815.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":66.0606,"dd_52w":-33.9394,"mdd_1y":-39.0625,"atr14_pct":78.5714,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":64.2383,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":1.27,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":95.0,"op_margin_q":6.0587,"op_qoq":204.3956,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":214.4578,"rev_yoy":-24.7962,"op_trend_4q":73.5223,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-91.33,"debt_ratio":681.62,"per":null,"pbr":0.37,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.27,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"143210","name":"핸즈코퍼레이션","m